1173
01:22:52,328 --> 01:22:56,628
あ、「TRUST HEART」！それだ！「TRUST HEART」だ！そう、あれかっこいいよね。
Ah, "TRUST HEART"! That's it! It's "TRUST HEART"! Yeah, that one's so cool, isn't it?

1174
