1180
01:23:32,128 --> 01:23:40,628
お主らのを見て、選んで、カラオケとか諸々大丈夫とかを確認した上で、検討しよう。うん。
I'll look at your suggestions, pick one, check if it's available in karaoke and all that, and then consider it. Yeah.

1181
