やっぱ今日ボカロ少なかったからな。今日ボカロ少なかったからな。
After all, there wasn't much Vocaloid today. Didn't have much Vocaloid today.

1255
01:28:08,936 --> 01:28:11,336
行くのじゃー！よいしょー！
Here we go-! Yoisho-!

1256
01:28:14,036 --> 01:28:19,036
じゃじゃじゃつちゃらっちゃ、しゃっちゃらちゃらじゃつちゃつちゃつじゃー
Djadja djatsu chara-tcha, shatcharachara djatsu djatsu djatsu djaa~

1257
01:28:22,136 --> 01:28:24,636
ちゃららっ、ちゃら。来た。
Charara-t, chara. Here it comes.

1258
01:28:34,336 --> 01:28:39,136
僕がずっと前から思ってる事を話そうか
Shall I tell you what I've been thinking about for so long?

1259
01:28:39,136 --> 01:28:43,836
友達に戻れたらこれ以上はもう望まないさ
If we could just go back to being friends, I wouldn't ask for anything more.

1260
01:28:43,936 --> 01:28:48,436
君がそれでいいなら僕だってそれで構わないさ
If you're fine with that, then I don't mind either.

1261
01:28:48,536 --> 01:28:55,336
嘘つきの僕が吐いたはんたいことばの愛の歌
A love song of opposites, spat out by a liar like me.

1262
01:29:12,136 --> 01:29:16,936
今日はこっちの地方はどしゃぶりの晴天でした
Today in this region, the weather was clear skies with pouring rain.

1263
01:29:17,036 --> 01:29:21,936
昨日もずっと暇で一日満喫してました
Yesterday I was totally free too, enjoying every bit of the day.

1264
01:29:22,036 --> 01:29:26,536
別に君のことなんて考えてなんかないさ
It's not like I'm thinking about you or anything.

1265
01:29:26,636 --> 01:29:30,836
いやでもちょっと本当は考えてたかもなんて
Well, but actually... maybe I was thinking of you just a bit.

1266
01:29:30,936 --> 01:29:35,436
メリーゴーランドみたいに回る
Spinning round and round like a merry-go-round,

1267
01:29:35,536 --> 01:29:39,036
僕の頭ん中はもうグルグルさ
inside my head is already swirling dizzyingly.

1268
01:29:39,136 --> 01:29:43,936
この両手から零れそうなほど
So much that it seems about to spill from both my hands,

1269
01:29:44,036 --> 01:29:48,536
君に貰った愛はどこに捨てよう？
where should I throw away the love you gave me?

1270
01:29:48,636 --> 01:29:53,036
限りのある消耗品なんて僕は
A consumable good with a limited lifespan...

1271
01:29:53,136 --> 01:29:57,936
要らないよ
I don't need it.

1272
01:29:58,336 --> 01:30:00,144
僕がずっと前から
What I've been thinking about for so long...

1273
01:30:00,144 --> 01:30:02,544
僕がずっと前から思ってる事を話そうか
Shall I tell you what I've been thinking for so long?

1274
01:30:02,944 --> 01:30:07,594
姿は見えないのに 言葉だけ見えちゃってるんだ
Even though you're nowhere to be seen, only your words are visible

1275
01:30:07,744 --> 01:30:12,494
僕が知らないことがあるだけで 気が狂いそうだ
Just knowing there are things about you I don't know drives me crazy

1276
01:30:12,644 --> 01:30:17,444
ぶら下がった感情が 綺麗なのか汚いのか
Whether these dangling feelings are beautiful or filthy,

1277
01:30:17,544 --> 01:30:25,094
僕にはまだわからず 捨てる宛てもないんだ
I still don't know, and I have nowhere to throw them away

1278
01:30:26,644 --> 01:30:31,044
言葉の裏の裏が見えるまで待つからさ
I'll wait until I can see beyond the other side of your words...

1279
01:30:31,194 --> 01:30:34,844
待つくらいならいいじゃないか
...so wouldn't just waiting be fine?

1280
01:30:35,444 --> 01:30:40,044
進む君と 止まった僕の
Between you moving forward and me standing still,

1281
01:30:40,194 --> 01:30:44,394
縮まらない隙を何で埋めよう?
how can I fill this unbridgeable gap?

1282
01:30:44,944 --> 01:30:50,644
まだ素直に言葉に出来ない僕は
Still unable to put my feelings honestly into words,

1283
01:30:52,544 --> 01:30:54,744
天性の弱虫さ
I'm a natural-born coward

1284
01:30:55,144 --> 01:31:00,944
この両手から零れそうなほど 君に渡す愛を
This love meant for you, overflowing from my hands...

1285
01:31:01,094 --> 01:31:04,044
誰に譲ろう?
...who else could I possibly give it to?

1286
01:31:04,244 --> 01:31:09,644
そんなんどこにも宛てがあるわけないだろ
There's obviously nowhere else for it to go

1287
01:31:10,994 --> 01:31:16,144
まだ待つよ
I'll keep waiting...

1288
01:31:18,144 --> 01:31:21,194
もういいかい
...are you ready yet?

1289
01:31:31,144 --> 01:31:36,644
だーだー
Da-da...

1290
01:31:37,544 --> 01:31:41,044
ありがとうございましたのじゃ〜
Thank you so much-noja!

1291
01:31:41,944 --> 01:31:45,744
天ノ弱でしたのじゃ〜！
That was "Amanojaku"-noja!

1292
01:31:46,544 --> 01:31:47,944
いかがでしたか？
How did you like it?

1293
01:31:48,444 --> 01:31:53,144
なかなか、いっぱいの曲が歌えたんじゃなかろうか。
I think I managed to sing quite a lot of songs today!

1294
01:31:53,744 --> 01:31:55,844
どうじゃどうじゃ？
How was it, how was it?

1295
01:31:56,344 --> 01:31:57,344
最高？
The best?

1296
01:31:57,444 --> 01:31:58,344
かわいい？
Cute?

1297
01:31:58,444 --> 01:32:00,744
やったのじゃ〜！
Yay-noja!

1298
01:32:01,144 --> 01:32:03,844
「神枠」ときた！やったのじゃ〜！
"God-tier stream," they say! Yay-noja!

1299
01:32:03,994 --> 01:32:07,644
よければね、あのー歌枠はね、切り抜きが禁止なので、
If you'd like... Since clips of singing streams aren't allowed,

